Bind Npc 29027 Zone 71 for elmorad
Quest 719 "[Lemegeton] The other door"
    Journal for karus "You must join the devil war with [Order of the Sorcery] Bros."
    Journal for elmorad "You must join the devil war with [Order of the Sorcery] Sais."
    Collect 1 of 900237000
    Collect 1 of 900238000

Requires (player level >= 71 and player is karus and quest 717 is completed) or (player level >= 71 and player is elmorad and quest 718 is completed)

Rewards
    Give 250000 experience
    Give 30000 coins

On available
    Say "Master, hurry and give the seal Scroll to Bros of [Order of the Sorcery]!"
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    If player is karus
        Say "You are here. Your last work was great."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "Please give me the seal Scroll that you will seal in your body, then, <selfname>.\n\nWe must give Bros of [Order of the Sorcery] of Ronark Land the seal Scrolls for [33Devil] Gaap and [57Devil] Ose."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "You are here. Your last work was great."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "Please give me the seal Scroll that you will seal in your body, then, <selfname>.\n\nWe must give Sais of [Order of the Sorcery] of Ronark Land the seal Scrolls for [33Devil] Gaap and [57Devil] Ose."

On in_progress
    Say "Where is the seal Scroll?"

On claimable
    Show quest "Thank you. With this seal Scroll, the soul of devil will be locked in this ring."

On completed
    Say "Time to cross into another world. [21Devil] General Marax of 36 troops is another devil with many troops. With him are powerful [45Devil] Vine and [65Devil] Andrealphus. Please eliminate and seal their souls."
